.TH Y5.COMPOSITOR.MONITOR 1 "July 2026" "y5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
y5.compositor.monitor \- developer log viewer for the Y5 compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B y5.compositor.monitor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B y5.compositor.monitor
is a graphical viewer for the Y5 compositor's structured log stream.
It connects to a running compositor over gRPC and displays the records
emitted by the compositor's built-in logging system live.
.PP
The verbosity of the stream is controlled by the compositor's
configuration
.RI ( log_level " in " settings.json ),
not by this viewer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR y5.compositor (1),
.BR y5.compositor.settings (1)
